013849,"text":"どんな依頼があるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[200310111]},{"nodeId":200310111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1512,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":1450256689,"text":"いろいろありますよ～。民衆のために怪物を倒すとか、簡単なものから危険なものまで様々。","nextNodeIds":[200310112]},{"nodeId":200310112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1512,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":2510785025,"text":"百聞は一見に如かず、依頼を受けたほうがより分かりやすいと思います。","nextNodeIds":[200310113]},{"nodeId":200310113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1512,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":1013595737,"text":"これが今日の依頼内容です。","nextNodeIds":[200310114]},{"nodeId":200310114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1512,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":961090457,"text":"終わったら報告しに来てくださいね。ちゃんと豪華報酬を用意して待ってますから。","nextNodeIds":[200310115,200310117]},{"nodeId":200310115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2326879937,"text":"任せて。","nextNodeIds":[200310116]},{"nodeId":200310116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1512,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":3024704921,"text":"#さすが{NICKNAME}、頼もしいですね。","nextNodeIds":[200310119]},{"nodeId":200310119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1512,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":3316176049,"text":"#ここで待ってますからね、{NICKNAME}。星と深淵を目指せ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":200310117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3377260177,"text":"どれくらい豪華？","nextNodeIds":[200310118]},{"nodeId":200310118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1512,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":3010714257,"text":"そんなに焦らないで、絶対に失望はさせませんから期待しててください。","nextNodeIds":[200310119]},{"nodeId":200310105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":51956833,"text":"少し大変だ。","nextNodeIds":[200310106]},{"nodeId":200310106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1512,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":1112298145,"text":"大丈夫、最初はみんなそうです。冒険する前に万全な準備をすると少しは楽になると思いますよ。","nextNodeIds":[200310107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINL